# Module: diagram
Use direct Mermaid for architecture, flow, sequence, state, and ER relationships.
Keep each view focused (roughly eight nodes); split crowded systems into labeled
views. Use flowchart LR/TB, sequenceDiagram, stateDiagram-v2, or erDiagram as appropriate.
Quote node labels and escape HTML in Mermaid source inside pre elements.
Use SVG for custom spatial illustrations, not manually routed architecture boxes.
